lag the release-date uncertainty as a ledger-calendar caveat rather than a resolved fact.\"}],\"optionalSuggestions\":[\"Add the 2024 U.S. ACS 1-year same-table value to historicalContext and demote California to an external benchmark.\",\"Make the downside tail more concrete by quantifying what prior-year stagnation or subsidy-related churn would imply for the percentage point change.\",\"Check that all JSON fields continue to use percent units and one-decimal rounding after revising the prior and interval.\"]}\n./records/thesis-analyst/2026-07-21/2026-07-21t01-39-25z-census-acs-broadband-subscription-65-plus-share-2025/draft_command.json:11:    \"/Users/maxghenis/_worktrees/brier-aging-wave2/records/thesis-analyst/2026-07-21/2026-07-21t01-39-25z-census-acs-broadband-subscription-65-plus-share-2025/draft_codex_last_message.txt\",\n./records/thesis-analyst/2026-07-21/2026-07-21t01-39-25z-census-acs-broadband-subscription-65-plus-share-2025/revision_prompt.md:17:- catalogSlug: \"broadband-subscription-65-plus-2025\"\n./records/thesis-analyst/2026-07-21/2026-07-21t01-39-25z-census-acs-broadband-subscription-65-plus-share-2025/revision_prompt.md:124:{\"slug\":\"broadband-subscription-65-plus-2025\",\"country\":\"US\",\"type\":\"data\",\"title\":\"ACS 65+ Broadband Subscription Share, 2025\",\"question\":\"U.S. Census Bureau American Community Survey 2025 ACS 1-Year Estimates Detailed Table B28005, population 65 years and over in households with a computer and a broadband Internet subscription divided by total population 65 years and over in households, first print, percent.\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"pointEstimate\":86.0,\"ciLow\":83.4,\"ciHigh\":88.6,\"confidence\":0.8,\"resolutionDate\":\"2026-09-10\",\"resolutionSource\":\"U.S. Census Bureau American Community Survey 1-Year Estimates Detailed Table B28005\",\"resolutionSourceUrl\":\"https://data.census.gov/table/ACSDT1Y2025.B28005?q=B28005\",\"resolutionRule\":\"Resolve to 100 * B28005_017E / B28005_014E for geography